Package: totaljs-developer-server
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: totaljs-developer-release (>= 1.0.9), totaljs-node (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-brand (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-docker-stack (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-dns (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-center (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-fetch (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-fnm (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-services (>= 1.0.0),
 ca-certificates, curl, wget, gnupg, git, unzip, zip, zstd, xz-utils,
 build-essential, pkg-config, python3-minimal,
 htop, nano, vim, less, tree, jq, tmux, sudo,
 openssh-server, ufw, fail2ban, software-properties-common,
 postgresql-client, sqlite3, git-lfs, gh, ripgrep, fd-find, fzf, bat, httpie, neovim
Homepage: https://www.totaljs.com
Description: Total.js Developer Distro, server edition
 The command-line environment for developing with Total.js: Node.js and Total.js,
 the usual tools of a developer (the clients of PostgreSQL and SQLite, GitHub CLI, ripgrep, fzf, bat, HTTPie, Neovim), the manager of versions of Node.js, an SSH server, a firewall and fail2ban. This package installs the pieces;
 each one is a package of its own and can be updated alone.
